<li id="menu-item-128" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-128"><a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/about-us/the-team/">The Team</a></li>
<li id="menu-item-1719" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1719"><a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/about-us/who-we-work-with/">Who We Work With</a></li>
</ul>
                    <h1 class="page-title no-margin pt-[150px] pb-[60px] has-shadows">Seneca Impact Advisors – Our Work and Who We Serve</h1>
                </div>
            </div>
            
        </section>

        <section class="inside-page pt-[60px] mb-[60px]">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between pt-3 md:pt-6">
                    <div class="sm:w-7/12 lg:w-8/12">
                        <div class="content">
                            <h2><span style="color: #ffffff;">Advancing Nature Finance</span></h2>
<p>Seneca Impact Advisors works with partners to shape and deliver nature-positive investment strategies. As a purpose-driven impact advisory and development organisation, we advance innovative financial solutions to scale commercially viable nature- and climate-positive projects. Our mission is to mobilise private-sector capital to protect and restore the natural world, combining financial expertise with an NGO-level focus on impact.</p>
<p>Seneca was founded to bridge the gap between traditional conservation funding and private investment capital seeking returns, helping advance biodiversity finance and other market-based approaches to conservation and restoration. While interest in nature-based solutions and biodiversity finance is growing, few projects meet the criteria for scalability and commercial viability. We work with leading NGOs, governments, development finance institutions, multilateral agencies, environmentally driven entrepreneurs, and TNFD-aligned corporates to originate and develop projects that meet funders’ expectations for impact and performance.</p>
<p>As public awareness of the climate crisis, biodiversity loss, and resource depletion grows, so does the demand for nature- and climate-positive investment opportunities. Seneca combines a deep commitment to the natural world with financial and technical expertise to shape strategies, design innovative solutions, mobilize capital, and accelerate initiatives that deliver measurable environmental and social outcomes, creating long-term value for investors, communities, and ecosystems.</p>
<h2>How we work</h2>
<p>We work alongside partners across the full lifecycle of nature-positive investments, from early-stage opportunity shaping through to capital mobilisation, combining strategic advisory with hands-on development and co-designing solutions, programmes, and platforms to structure and scale investable initiatives, while building the capabilities needed to sustain and replicate them, with a focus on translating ideas into commercially viable outcomes that deliver measurable impact.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="overview-image mb-[60px]">
                                </section>

        <section class="mb-[100px]">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between pt-3 md:pt-6">
                    <div class="sm:w-7/12 lg:w-8/12">
                        <div class="content">
                            <hr />
<h2></h2>
<h2><span style="color: #ffffff;">Our o</span><span style="color: #ffffff;">fferings</span></h2>
<h3><span style="color: #6699aa;">Scope of Work and Solutions</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Project <a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/capability/project-discovery/">origination</a> and early‑stage development</li>
<li>Landscape, sector, and institutional <a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/capability/strategic-intellegence/">analysis</a></li>
<li>Economic analysis and incentive alignment</li>
<li>Project economics and financial design</li>
<li>Blended finance and <a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/capability/financial-innovation/">capital structure design</a></li>
<li>Project pipeline and origination platform development</li>
<li><a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/capability/capital-mobilisation/">Capital mobilisation</a> and funding strategy</li>
<li>Environmental and social safeguards</li>
<li><a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/capability/policy-regulation/">Policy analysis</a> and regulatory frameworks</li>
<li>Impact assessment, outcomes, and learning</li>
<li><a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/capability/project-development/">Project and investment structuring</a>, due diligence, and risk management</li>
<li>Strategic support through early implementation and scale‑up</li>
<li>Capacity building, training, and programme co-design</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr />
<h3></h3>
<h3><span style="color: #6699aa;">Investment Themes — Focus Areas of Work</span></h3>
<p><a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/investment_themes/land-use/"><strong>Land Use</strong></a> — Regenerative agriculture; agroforestry; reforestation</p>
<p><a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/investment_themes/food-systems/"><strong>Food Systems </strong></a>— Climate-resilient food production; food waste utilisation; food security</p>
<p><a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/investment_themes/bioenrgy/"><strong>Bioenergy</strong></a> — Waste-to-energy; organic conversion; biogas; agrovoltaics; floating solar</p>
<p><a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/investment_themes/freshwater/"><strong>Freshwater</strong></a> — Rivers and watersheds; wetlands; water security</p>
<p><a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/investment_themes/coastal-ecosystems/"><strong>Coastal Ecosystems</strong></a> — Mangroves; blue carbon; reef restoration; plastic pollution; livelihoods</p>
<p><a href="https://senecaimpact.earth/investment_themes/urban-nature/"><strong>Urban Nature </strong></a>— Nature-based solutions in cities; green infrastructure; urban biodiversity</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr />
<h3></h3>
<h3><span style="color: #6699aa;">Strategic Engagements – Advisory</span></h3>
<p>Our core business is providing strategic advice and hands-on support to governments, development agencies, development finance institutions, private-sector investors, intergovernmental organisations, NGOs, philanthropic groups, and TNFD-aligned corporates. We help scope, shape, and structure high-impact projects—from early-stage opportunity framing to investment design and capital mobilisation. This includes aligning stakeholders, crafting nature-positive strategies, and building financial models that unlock blended capital and support biodiversity finance initiatives. Our work is grounded in deep sectoral insight, financial expertise, and a commitment to long-term outcomes.</p>
<p><strong>For institutional or advisory enquiries, please reach out via <a class="fui-Link ___w5et180 f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1mo0ibp fjoy568 ff5ikls f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a" tabindex="0" href="mailto:impact@senecaimpact.earth" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-tabster="{&quot;restorer&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:1}}">impact@senecaimpact.earth</a>.</strong></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr />
<h3></h3>
<h3><span style="color: #6699aa;">Project Acceleration &amp; Funding Strategy</span></h3>
<p>We work closely with project developers, local implementers, and solution owners to accelerate nature- and climate-positive initiatives and strengthen their funding strategy. Our support spans technical refinement, financial structuring, and strategic positioning, enabling projects to attract capital, accelerate implementation, and scale their impact.</p>
<p>Whether you&#8217;re restoring mangroves, piloting regenerative agriculture, or deploying climate-resilient solutions, Seneca helps bridge the gap between vision and capital. We bring a collaborative mindset and practical tools to help projects attract funding, align with investor expectations, and deliver measurable outcomes for communities and ecosystems.</p>
<p><strong>For project-related enquiries, please contact us at <a class="fui-Link ___w5et180 f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1mo0ibp fjoy568 ff5ikls f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a" tabindex="0" href="mailto:projects@senecaimpact.earth" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-tabster="{&quot;restorer&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:1}}">projects@senecaimpact.earth</a>.</strong></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr />
<h3></h3>
<h3><span style="color: #6699aa;">Partnerships &amp; Collaborative Ventures</span></h3>
<p>Seneca actively cultivates partnerships that amplify impact and unlock new opportunities for nature-positive investment. We collaborate with mission-aligned organisations, investors, entrepreneurs, and technical partners to co-develop initiatives, structure blended finance vehicles, and launch thematic investment platforms.</p>
<p>Our partnerships span strategic alliances, joint ventures, and custom co-investment models. Whether you&#8217;re exploring a new fund concept, seeking to syndicate capital, or looking for a trusted partner to shape your nature and climate strategy, we’re ready to engage.</p>
<p><strong>If you&#8217;re exploring ways to work together, please contact us at <a class="fui-Link ___w5et180 f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1mo0ibp fjoy568 ff5ikls f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a" tabindex="0" href="mailto:partnerships@senecaimpact.earth" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-tabster="{&quot;restorer&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:1}}">partnerships@senecaimpact.earth</a>.</strong></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr />
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2>Initiatives</h2>
<p>Seneca&#8217;s active initiatives bring together programmes and partnerships developed alongside governments, multilateral organisations, NGOs, industry, investors, academia and local communities. These efforts align finance, expertise, technology and implementation to advance nature, climate and sustainable development.</p>
<p>These initiatives provide a structured approach to mobilising capital and accelerating implementation across complex challenges that no single organisation can address alone.</p>
<p><strong>To learn about our initiatives, please contact us at <a class="fui-Link ___w5et180 f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1mo0ibp fjoy568 ff5ikls f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a" tabindex="0" href="mailto:partnerships@senecaimpact.earth" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-tabster="{&quot;restorer&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:1}}">partnerships@senecaimpact.earth</a>.</strong></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr />
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2><span style="color: #ffffff;">Commitments</span></h2>
<p style="text-align: left;">We are committed members of the <a href="https://oceanriskalliance.org/">Ocean Risk and Resilience Action Alliance (ORRAA)</a>, the Nature Positive Forum as part of the <a href="https://www.naturepositive.org/">Nature Positive Initiative</a>, and signatories to the <a href="https://www.weps.org/">Women&#8217;s Empowerment Principles</a>.<em><br />
</em></p>
